      "description": "<p>When you make an Accuracy Check, Magic Check, or contested Check, you may spend <strong>1 Fabula Point</strong> and invoke one of the target’s Traits to add <strong>[SL]</strong> to your result against that target. A Villain may <strong>spend 2 Ultima Points</strong> to cancel out this effect. If the Check includes multiple targets, your result against those other targets is unchanged.</p>\n",
