      "heroic_requirement": "",
      "implementation_note": "Offered on Attack / Skill / Spell Checks (not Study), and only on a single-target Check (on a multi-target Check the bonus would apply to every target), and not on a free cast (its Fabula Point surcharge could not be charged). If a target is ADDED to the Check after Exploit is accepted (Barrage, a Grappled splash), the GM applies Exploit's bonus only against the original target. Name the Trait you invoke. Contested Checks outside the action card are resolved at the table. A Villain may spend 2 Ultima Points to cancel Exploit: the GM says so before Confirm and the player un-toggles the pill (no Fabula Point is spent); the GM deducts the Ultima Points on the villain's sheet.",
